---
/**
 * The 404, built from the same cover object as every issue — a plate that
 * stands where the missing issue would. It is written out here rather than
 * rendered through `Cover.astro` because there is no post behind it, and
 * inventing one to satisfy the component would be the wrong kind of tidy.
 */
---

<main class="flex-1">
  <div class="cs-nf">
    <div class="cs-cover cs-cover--deep cs-fit-xl cs-cover--noill">
      <span class="cs-cv">
        <span class="cs-cv-band">
          <span>Missing issue</span>
          <span>404</span>
        </span>
        <span class="cs-cv-title">
          <span class="cs-cv-kicker">Not on the shelf</span>
          <span class="cs-cv-h">This issue was never printed</span>
        </span>
        <span class="cs-cv-foot">
          <span class="cs-cv-author">Out of catalogue</span>
        </span>
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="cs-nf-text">
      <h1>Nothing is filed at this address.</h1>
      <p>The page you are looking for does not exist, or the issue has been moved.</p>
      <a class="cs-back" href="/">&larr; Back to the shelf</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
